'''Mesmer [[Ascalon armor]]''' is an armor art type introduced in the Prophecies campaign as starter armor (called '''Dilettante's armor''') and is also available in the Factions campaign.

'''Note''': The art for Mesmer Ascalon armor does not include headgear, but the [[Mesmer Discreet Mask|Discreet]], [[Mesmer Animal Mask|Animal]], [[Mesmer Costume Mask|Costume]], [[Mesmer Imposing Mask|Imposing]] and [[Mesmer Sleek Mask|Sleek]] masks are available from the same armorers in Factions. In Prophecies an otherwise unnamed mask like the Discreet Mask is used with the Dilettante's set.

There is no [[Prestige armor|prestige]] version of Ascalon armor.

